{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0140355 cargo receptor ligand activity\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/32466\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1UMDHJ1WKs5u6IX3HaF4QrOsH5-l_vUhf35fILGAJeI0/edit?usp=sharing\n\nImpacted groups: \nMGI 2\nReactome 3\nSGD 1\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-09-10T14:51:51Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0140355 cargo receptor ligand activity", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-09-23T22:18:27Z"}
